Preferred Gamerules for Sunrise

A port of Preferred Gamerules 1.1.1 by Estecka.
Original source: https://github.com/Estecka/mc-Preferred-Gamerules
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust (no Java
code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko, on Sunrise's mod API, under the same licence.
